    | (WBS value) | (indent value) [ICON] ▼ (Name value) | ...  EXPANDED

    becomes:
    
    | (WBS value) | (indent value) [ICON] ▶ (Name value) | ...  COLLAPSED

[ ] Total eye candy feature: during auto-refresh updates of the chart
